# Generated data / outputs — never round-trip through version control,
# never get clobbered by a pull (DGX_GUIDE_nanovlm.md §0/§2).
# Leading "/" anchors these to the repo root ONLY — an unanchored "data/"
# would also match nanovlm/data/ (the model library's data subpackage,
# a real tracked source directory that happens to share the name) and
# silently exclude it from every commit. That bug already happened once;
# these are anchored specifically so it can't happen again.
/data/
/checkpoints/
/results/
/logs/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
